== Deity Specific Quests ==

=== Bertoxxulous ===

You must be a [[Cleric]] worshiping [[Bertoxxulous]] to complete these quests.

* [[Bertoxxulous Symbol Quests]]

=== Brell Serilis ===

You must be a [[Cleric]] worshiping [[Brell Serilis]] to complete these quests.

* [[Brell Serilis Symbol Quests]]

=== Cazic Thule ===

You must be a [[Cleric]] or [[Shaman]] worshiping [[Cazic-Thule]] to complete these quests.

* [[Cazic Thule Symbol Quests]]

=== Innoruuk ===

Completed by Troll Shaman at level 15.  You must worship [[Innoruuk]] to get this quest, but I did not need to do any additional faction work.

* [[Innoruuk Symbol Quests]]

=== Quellious ===

Specifically for [[Cleric]]s of the [[Erudite]] race.

* [[Quellious Symbol Quests]]

=== Rallos Zek ===

You must be an [[Ogre]] [[Shaman]] worshiping [[Rallos Zek]] to complete this quest.

* [[Rallos Zek Symbol Quests]]

=== The Tribunal ===

You must be a [[Barbarian]] [[Shaman]] worshiping [[The Tribunal]].

* [[Tribunal Symbol Quests]]

=== Tunare ===

You must worship [[Tunare]], and be either a [[Wizard]], [[Enchanter]], [[Ranger]], [[Paladin]], [[Magician]], [[Cleric]] or [[Druid]] to complete these quests.

* [[Tunare Symbol Quests]]
* [[Natures Defender Quest]]
* [[The Lost Tome]]
* [[Gloves of Earthcrafting Quest]]
* [[Helm of the Tracker Quest]]
* [[Scrolls of the Ancient Totem]]
* [[The Four Idols]]
* [[The Ancient Tomes]]

